  "description": "Tomari Marina \u2014 a block theme for a small-boat marina and berth operator. A cool mist ground, deep harbour ink and one ink-teal band, with Newsreader over Literata. The home page opens on a full-bleed low-key photograph of a harbour master and an owner on a pontoon, then a pinned three-step frame (tall portrait, bracketed word, giant thin numeral), a parallax dawn band, a hairline harbour board with the fee table and a pale open-today tab, the crew, the logbook and a booking close. Works without any plugin.",
